:::info[Description]
This endpoint allows users to cancel orders via WebSocket.
:::

:::tip[]
For sections **1 ~ 4**, **7**, and **GATEWAY ERROR CODE**, refer to **[Pro WS Add Order](/docs-new/3470133w0)**.
