> #### 2. [Signature and Authentication](/docs-new/3470133w0#2-signature-and-authentication)
> #### 3. [Reconnection](/docs-new/3470133w0#3-reconnection)
> #### 4. [Ping](/docs-new/3470133w0#4-ping)
> #### 7. [Python Example](/docs-new/3470133w0#7-python-example)
> #### [GATEWAY ERROR CODE](/docs-new/3470133w0#gateway-error-code)
:::

